BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:LGBTQ+ Democratic Caucus Meeting
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20270109T073000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20270109T090000
UID:a2789c70562b74afe9122c83ecb8d2de@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/LGBTQ%20Caucus%20banner%2060x24%20%281200%20x%20630%20px%29%2
 0%281%29_20261124140642581897.png
DESCRIPTION:Come join us at our January LGBTQ+ Caucus monthly meeting wher
 e we will discuss next steps for 2027. And specifically\, we are excited t
 o discuss plans for an LGBTQ+ Senior Advocacy Forum\, projected for May\, 
 focusing on our collective experience\, knowledge and creative vision for 
 how the aging population in our community can best be supported and thrive
 . We look forward to seeing you there! Who should attend: All those who id
 entify as LGBTQ+ and allies.
LOCATION:Buncombe County Democratic Headquarters\, 951 Old Fairview Rd\, A
 sheville\, NC\, 28803
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/buncombedems/event/1082919/
X-SOURCE:Buncombe County Democratic Party
END:VEVENT
