 e fun while doing it. This month\, in honor of the holiday season\, we're 
 changing it up. Instead of reading a book\, we'll be reading "The Grace We
  Seek but Have Forgotten" by Lydia Sohn\, a United Methodist minister. It 
 was published in the New York Times on Oct. 25\, 2026. If you are unable t
 o
